From b4e6262235afbe8b28a92f8b8e2b30ec74f3e68d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:51:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): accessible names for the fixture dialogs' and rows'
 input widgets

Slice of #1119: the plate, vise, accessory and library dialogs and the
fixture/plate/mod-vise rows name their DragValue, TextEdit and ComboBox
inputs through AccessKit (labelled_by the row's label, or a plain name
where nothing is drawn). Nothing visible changes. Guard tests walk the
dialogs and the page and fail on an unnamed input.

Refs #1119

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
